Note FizzBuzz, the classic counting game end note.
Count from 1 to 15 using i,
  Set shout to text end text.
  If i remainder of 3 is equal to 0, then
    Set shout to text Fizz end text.
  end if.
  If i remainder of 5 is equal to 0, then
    Set shout to shout joined with text Buzz end text.
  end if.
  If shout is equal to text end text, then
    Say i.
  otherwise
    Say shout.
  end if.
end loop.
